oad.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I measure whether an explainer video worked?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Track engagement (watch time, click-through), conversion on the page carrying the video, support requests, and feedback from the sales team. A/B testing shows which version performs.\"}}]}]}"}></script>
